208053 1794391915.698825 write(1, "    HX3 200 hoses, 40 relay frames (up to 24 strands re-posed a frame): old policy 2236 ms (max 79/frame), index 185 ms (max 6.7/frame); re-collections 4500 vs 8000; span builds 3048, marks 3884\r\n", 196) = 196
208053 1794391915.699075 write(1, "ok    HX3 a relay wave on the basin strands: the index equals all-pairs every frame and re-checks only near strands\r\n", 117) = 117
